    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d359">

                <pb facs="0480" n="364" xml:id="pg364"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 422.11G93/816.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Hartman</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-10-23T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 23, 1915—4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your October 21, 3 p.m. Report briefly nature and scope of private settlement
                    negotiations. Nothing known by Railway Company, New York.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
